flowchart LR
  %% ProofFleet architecture — current hardening + live-evidence contract

  subgraph CLIENT[Human + Web UI]
    H[Human Operator]
    UI[React + TypeScript UI]
    H --> UI
  end

  subgraph RUNTIME[ProofFleet Express Runtime]
    API[Express API + FleetRunner]

    subgraph AGENTS[8 Core Roles]
      O[1 Orchestrator\nGoogle ADK + Gemini 3.7 Flash]
      S[2 Scout\nGoogle ADK + Gemini 3.7 Flash\nUNGROUNDED unless real source tool]
      B[3 Builder\ndeterministic-runtime]
      A[4 Analyst\ndeterministic-runtime]
      SE[5 Sentinel\ndeterministic-runtime]
      AU[6 Auditor\ndeterministic-runtime]
      G[7 Gatekeeper\ndeterministic-runtime]
      OP[8 Operator\ndeterministic-runtime]
      O --> S --> B --> A --> SE --> AU --> G
    end

    C{Explicit operation-bound\nhuman consent}
    G --> C
    C -->|APPROVED| OP
    C -->|REJECTED| J

    EX[OperationExecutor\nIdempotency + readback-before-retry]
    OP --> EX

    MEM[(Memory Store\ncontext only — never truth)]
    O -. advisory .-> MEM
    S -. advisory .-> MEM

    EV[(Evidence Ledger +\nSHA-256 Receipt Chain)]
    V[Independent Verifier\nread-only snapshots]
    J[Non-mutating Judge]
    EV --> V --> J

    J --> V1[VERIFIED]
    J --> V2[BLOCKED_BY_MISSING_EVIDENCE]
    J --> V3[CONTRADICTED]
  end

  UI --> API
  API --> O

  subgraph GOOGLEAI[Google AI]
    ADK[Google ADK\nGemini 3.7 Flash]
  end
  ADK -->|AGENT_OUTPUT + model ID + output hash| O
  ADK -->|context only; no fake citations| S

  O --> EV
  S --> EV
  B --> EV
  A --> EV
  SE --> EV
  AU --> EV
  G --> EV
  OP --> EV

  subgraph GCP[Google Cloud provider boundaries]
    WIF[GitHub OIDC / Workload Identity Federation]
    OCI[Artifact Registry\nOCI index → linux/amd64 manifest]
    CR[Cloud Run candidate\nauthoritative revision readback]
    FS[(Firestore\noperation-bound effect + readback)]
    WIF --> OCI
    WIF --> CR
    WIF --> FS
    OCI -->|registry-proven runtime digest| CR
  end

  EX -->|only after explicit consent| FS
  FS -->|FIRESTORE_READBACK| EV
  CR -->|CLOUD_RUN_READBACK + declared source SHA| EV

  LIVE[Cloud Run candidate receipt\nOBSERVED · 0% normal traffic]
  PENDING[Remaining provider boundary\nADK live canary NOT_RUN\nFirestore live effect not OBSERVED]
  CR --> LIVE
  WIF -. fail-closed .-> PENDING
